    "title": {
      "en": "Greenfinch or Siskin?"
    },
    "text": {
      "en": "Both are green and yellow. A Greenfinch is bigger and heavier, with a thick bill and no black on the head. A Siskin is small and neat, with a black cap, a black chin and a thin bill."
    }
